{"id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-locally-confluent.md","title":"局部合流","display":"df-locally-confluent — 局部合流","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-locally-confluent","aliases":["56-df-locally-confluent"],"display":"df-locally-confluent — 局部合流","depends_on":["[[56-df-joinable]]","[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]"],"source_section":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.8(iii)","source_printed_pages":"10","source_ocr_blocks":[31],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-locally-confluent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-locally-confluent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-locally-confluent — 局部合流"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.8(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"10"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>31</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Join}\">\\(\\mathrm{Join}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\to b\\land a\\to c)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,b,c)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\to b\\land a\\to c)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,b,c)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书也称弱合流或WCR。定义不依赖Newman引理，避免定义与定理循环。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A\\times A$；单关系抽象归约系统见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Join}$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Join}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\to b\\land a\\to c)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,b,c)).","display":true}],"bytes":1115,"backlinks":[{"id":"36586b91fb39cf3d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于ZFC；局部合流、合流、正规形、可汇合与闭包见 [[56-df-locally-confluent]]、[[56-df-confluent]]、[[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-joinable]]、[[56-df-relation-closure]]。"},{"id":"f87aa675097602ab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-locally-confluent.md]]"},{"id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"CP、局部合流、可汇合见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]、[[56-df-locally-confluent]]、[[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"强正规化、局部合流、合流见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]、[[56-df-locally-confluent]]、[[56-df-confluent]]；工作于ZFC。"},{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1de67f45113d6dcf","89129816153530db"]}